<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 125 mln stg late help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 125 mln stg late help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with around 125 million stg of unspecified late assistance.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1100 GMT   1300 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.7 BLN    1.7 BLN    1.8 BLN    1.8 BLN</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    400 MLN!   850 MLN!!  1.136 BLN  1.261 BLN</p>
<p>DETAILS</p>
<p> BAND 1 BANK BILLS				    285 MLN*</p>
<p> BAND 2 BANK BILLS					1 MLN*</p>
<p> UNSPECIFIED ASSISTANCE					    125 MLN</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 400 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON OCT 21</p>
<p>&amp; 22 AT 5-23/32 PCT</p>
<p>!! INCLUDES 850 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON OCT</p>
<p>21 &amp; 22 AT 5-23/32 PCT  (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
